{"id":"11bfe06b58ad0c0f","group":"68","path":"68/68-df-theory-decidability.md","title":"Theories and Strong Undecidability","display":"df-theory-decidability — Theories and Strong Undecidability","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)","book_abbrev":"68","label":"68-df-theory-decidability","aliases":["68-df-theory-decidability"],"display":"df-theory-decidability — Theories and Strong Undecidability","depends_on":["[[68-df-first-order-syntax]]","[[68-df-first-order-semantics]]","[[68-df-recursive-function]]"],"source_edition":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF","source_location":"§11 p.34 / PDF 43, theory and decision problem definitions","verification_status":"source-adapted-definition","source_proof_status":"definition-construction-reviewed","revision_basis":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Recursion Theory (Shoenfield)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"68"},{"key":"label","html":"68-df-theory-decidability"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>68-df-theory-decidability</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-theory-decidability — Theories and Strong Undecidability"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"83dddcd7f37b01bd\" href=\"?note=83dddcd7f37b01bd\" title=\"68-df-first-order-syntax\">68-df-first-order-syntax</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"285deaa50ea04329\" href=\"?note=285deaa50ea04329\" title=\"68-df-first-order-semantics\">68-df-first-order-semantics</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_edition","html":"1993 original; 2016 Cambridge reissue, supplied PDF"},{"key":"source_location","html":"§11 p.34 / PDF 43, theory and decision problem definitions"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"source-adapted-definition"},{"key":"source_proof_status","html":"definition-construction-reviewed"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"supplied-68(2).zip; local scope, domain, and dependency review"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Signature}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Signature}(\\sigma)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"83dddcd7f37b01bd\" href=\"?note=83dddcd7f37b01bd\" title=\"68-df-first-order-syntax\">68-df-first-order-syntax</a>，结构、载体与满足取 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"285deaa50ea04329\" href=\"?note=285deaa50ea04329\" title=\"68-df-first-order-semantics\">68-df-first-order-semantics</a> 的同一签名接口。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,T&#39;\">\\(T,T&#39;\\)</span> 是候选公理集，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathbb N\">\\(p\\in\\mathbb N\\)</span>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"M\">\\(M\\)</span> 是候选结构。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{TotalRec}\">\\(\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"a82d826d433dcff3\" href=\"?note=a82d826d433dcff3\" title=\"68-df-recursive-function\">68-df-recursive-function</a>，在本条款中要求一元全函数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\">\\(\\mathbb N\\to\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>。</p>\n<p>模型和后承条款使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"285deaa50ea04329\" href=\"?note=285deaa50ea04329\" title=\"68-df-first-order-semantics\">68-df-first-order-semantics</a> 中对所有候选结构定义的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\">\\(\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_{68}(M)\">\\(D_{68}(M)\\)</span> 在非法结构候选上为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\varnothing\">\\(\\varnothing\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Signature}(\\sigma)\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Signature}(\\sigma)\\land T\\subseteq\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Model}_{68}(\\sigma,T,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\land\\forall p\\in T\\;\\forall\\eta\\in D_{68}(M)^\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Model}_{68}(\\sigma,T,M)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\land\\forall p\\in T\\;\\forall\\eta\\in D_{68}(M)^\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T,p)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)\\land\\forall M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Model}_{68}(\\sigma,T,M)\\Longrightarrow\\forall\\eta\\in D_{68}(M)^\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T,p)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land p\\in\\operatorname{Sent}_{68}(\\sigma)\\land\\forall M\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Model}_{68}(\\sigma,T,M)\\Longrightarrow\\forall\\eta\\in D_{68}(M)^\\mathbb N\\;\\operatorname{Sat}_{68}(M,p,\\eta)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\exists h\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(h(p)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T,p)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\exists h\\in\\mathrm{TotalRec}\\cap\\{0,1\\}^{\\mathbb N}\\;\\forall p\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\bigl(h(p)=1\\Longleftrightarrow\\operatorname{Con}_{68}(\\sigma,T,p)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\neg\\operatorname{DecTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\land\\forall T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Model}_{68}(\\sigma,T,M)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\bigr).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{StrongUnd}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{FOStr}_{68}(M,\\sigma)\\land\\forall T\\;\\bigl(\\operatorname{Model}_{68}(\\sigma,T,M)\\Longrightarrow\\operatorname{UndTheory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\bigr).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FinExt}_{68}(\\sigma,T,T&#39;)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T&#39;)\\land T\\subseteq T&#39;\\land|T&#39;\\setminus T|&lt;\\aleph_0.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FinExt}_{68}(\\sigma,T,T&#39;)\\;\\Longleftrightarrow\\;\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T)\\land\\operatorname{Theory}_{68}(\\sigma,T&#39;)\\land T\\subseteq T&#39;\\land|T&#39;\\setminus T|&lt;\\aleph_0.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 §11，印刷 p.34 / PDF p.43，把 theorem 直接定义为在所有模型中真；本文件的 Con 是这种语义后承，未额外引入一个未经证明完备性的推演系统。理论包括有限语言和任意句子公理集，strongly undecidable 量化所有以该结构为模型的理论，不仅是递归可公理化理论。原书 decision problem 输入为合法句子；此处给所有自然数输入的二值判定，非法句子码输出 0。上游句法的可判定性说明两种输入约定等价。用 TotalRec 精确替换算法是 Church–Turing 表述下的递归论版本；数学后承及结构语义本身不依赖该论题。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"68-df-first-order-syntax","status":"resolved","id":"83dddcd7f37b01bd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-first-order-syntax]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-first-order-semantics","status":"resolved","id":"285deaa50ea04329","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[68-df-first-order-semantics]]","embed":false},{"target":"68-df-recursive-function","status":"resolved","id":"a82d826d433dcff3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","locat